WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.112
=Episode 2=

01:48.296 --> 01:49.296
Sorry for the wait.

01:54.617 --> 01:56.736
You... You're that 'costs extra' guy?

01:57.176 --> 01:57.977
Miss Zhu Mengmeng?

01:58.937 --> 02:00.456
How could it be you?

02:02.096 --> 02:03.456
It's unexpected. I'm surprised.

02:06.617 --> 02:08.737
Mr. Gao, the dishes
are ready to be served.

02:09.297 --> 02:09.696
Okay.

02:17.457 --> 02:18.217
Miss Zhu Mengmeng,

02:18.937 --> 02:20.416
although I already know your name,

02:20.617 --> 02:22.816
shouldn't we formally
introduce ourselves?

02:22.937 --> 02:24.416
I don't think that's necessary.

02:25.096 --> 02:26.976
This blind date
was forced on me by my family.

02:27.297 --> 02:28.217
I didn't want to come.

02:29.057 --> 02:30.057
And you...

02:32.497 --> 02:34.057
You're not getting younger.

02:34.057 --> 02:35.096
And your family's pushing.

02:35.576 --> 02:37.256
But me, I've always thought

02:37.576 --> 02:39.057
we should enjoy life while young.

02:39.416 --> 02:40.017
Right?

02:46.656 --> 02:48.777
What a real shame, though.

02:49.337 --> 02:52.856
You look all proper and respectable
on the surface,

02:53.777 --> 02:56.057
but secretly, you're quite the player.

02:59.656 --> 03:01.656
I'm meeting my ex for clubbing tonight.

03:01.656 --> 03:02.376
Want to join us?

03:02.897 --> 03:04.536
No thanks. I have plans later.

03:05.217 --> 03:07.217
Seriously?

03:07.656 --> 03:09.457
Young people should have fun.

03:10.136 --> 03:10.937
Don't tell me you...

03:17.136 --> 03:17.937
I see.

03:19.737 --> 03:20.617
Have an oyster.

03:22.096 --> 03:22.696
Thanks.

03:24.497 --> 03:26.576
(Seriously? Not even mad?)

03:34.737 --> 03:35.376
What?

03:35.856 --> 03:37.017
This is how I relax.

03:37.576 --> 03:38.576
You don't mind, do you?

03:40.457 --> 03:41.057
Suit yourself.

03:53.617 --> 03:56.057
Look at that handsome little face
of yours.

03:56.816 --> 03:59.897
Your body is pretty hot too.

04:01.217 --> 04:03.096
If I could just have a casual fling
with you,

04:03.096 --> 04:04.416
I wouldn't mind that at all.

04:05.536 --> 04:07.897
Too bad we're not really a match.

04:08.816 --> 04:09.337
I disagree.

04:11.096 --> 04:12.256
I think we're quite a match.

04:12.816 --> 04:14.457
Calm versus lively. Opposites attract.

04:17.136 --> 04:17.737
Is that so?

04:19.977 --> 04:22.297
But there's something
I think I should tell you upfront.

04:23.857 --> 04:25.376
I'm pregnant. Eight weeks.

04:25.376 --> 04:26.417
The due date is next year.

04:26.617 --> 04:28.537
I'm guessing you mind?

04:28.896 --> 04:29.737
Of course not.

04:30.417 --> 04:31.937
You may not know much about my family.

04:32.417 --> 04:34.136
Before I marry and have kids,

04:34.136 --> 04:36.488
my father won't feel secure
giving me the family business.

04:36.977 --> 04:39.256
After we marry,
I can inherit the family fortune.

04:39.576 --> 04:41.297
And you won't have to
worry about gossip.

04:41.497 --> 04:43.256
We truly are a match made in heaven.

04:47.657 --> 04:48.336
I see.

04:48.937 --> 04:50.216
You've just taken a fancy to me.

04:51.537 --> 04:52.537
But listen to me.

04:53.376 --> 04:54.497
Someone like you...

04:57.376 --> 04:58.937
is actually pretty surprising.

05:00.576 --> 05:01.136
Alright.

05:01.497 --> 05:03.057
I'm off to go clubbing with my exes.

05:04.016 --> 05:05.977
But thanks again for the meal.

05:08.857 --> 05:12.216
Hello? Yes.
This is Gao Haiming from Letao.

05:19.256 --> 05:20.896
We need quicker emergency responses.

05:21.097 --> 05:22.776
If your company can't manage that,

05:23.177 --> 05:24.896
then I may turn to someone else.

05:30.297 --> 05:31.696
Good. I'll await your proposal.

05:36.097 --> 05:36.896
Anything else?

05:39.136 --> 05:40.216
I'm not full.

05:40.977 --> 05:41.776
Then take your time.

05:41.977 --> 05:42.816
I've paid the bill.

05:42.816 --> 05:43.776
Need to go. Bye.

05:44.216 --> 05:46.136
Wait, Gao Haiming.

05:47.297 --> 05:48.617
Gao Haiming! Hold on a second.

05:48.937 --> 05:50.984
Is there something else,
Miss Zhu Mengmeng?

05:50.984 --> 05:53.000
I think I need to explain something.

05:55.272 --> 05:56.576
I'm not a club-goer.

05:56.576 --> 05:57.737
I don't have that many exes.

05:57.737 --> 05:58.937
I've never even dated anyone.

05:58.937 --> 05:59.857
I'm very loyal.

05:59.977 --> 06:01.136
I don't go clubbing at night.

06:01.136 --> 06:02.136
And I'm not pregnant.

06:02.657 --> 06:03.696
Why tell me this?

06:05.456 --> 06:06.617
You might not believe this,

06:06.617 --> 06:09.937
but I suddenly realized
you're a great person.

06:10.376 --> 06:12.376
You're a gentleman, compassionate,

06:12.376 --> 06:13.336
tolerant,

06:13.336 --> 06:14.456
and very polite.

06:14.816 --> 06:16.776
So I think we should start over.

06:16.937 --> 06:18.657
I'm not Zhu Mengmeng. I'm Lin Huan...

06:18.657 --> 06:19.097
No need.

06:19.336 --> 06:20.896
I know you're not Miss Zhu Mengmeng.

06:22.097 --> 06:22.696
I've met her

06:22.696 --> 06:23.857
on other occasions.

06:24.016 --> 06:25.057
I just didn't say hello.

06:25.216 --> 06:25.896
But I'm certain

06:26.456 --> 06:28.336
Zhu Mengmeng
definitely doesn't have your face.

06:33.417 --> 06:36.057
I don't know why
you're impersonating Miss Zhu Mengmeng,

06:37.497 --> 06:38.497
but someone like you...

06:42.617 --> 06:43.696
is pretty surprising.

06:48.136 --> 06:51.537
Seriously? This is...

06:55.537 --> 06:58.297
Male Lead's fondness toward you: -50%.

06:58.657 --> 06:59.537
A hellish start.

06:59.816 --> 07:01.136
Player, you need to try harder.

07:01.136 --> 07:03.816
W-What kind of lousy system are you?

07:03.816 --> 07:06.776
What a lousy system!
Couldn't you hint when the boss arrived?

07:06.776 --> 07:07.977
A 'beep' would've helped.

07:08.336 --> 07:09.928
You misled me into making a mistake.

07:12.896 --> 07:14.136
Don't be mad. Don't be mad.

07:15.057 --> 07:16.057
Stay calm, Lin Huan'er.

07:17.057 --> 07:18.417
Your goal is to leave this book.

07:19.376 --> 07:20.057
Keep it up.

07:21.057 --> 07:21.937
You can do it.

07:22.896 --> 07:23.576
Get out of here.

07:23.857 --> 07:25.336
Do not damage the system.

07:31.576 --> 07:32.097
Mr. Gao,

07:32.177 --> 07:33.896
today's blind date
took 40 minutes in total.

07:34.216 --> 07:34.857
A new record.

07:40.297 --> 07:41.977
Know what to say if the chairman asks?

07:42.537 --> 07:43.696
I know. Don't worry.

07:44.177 --> 07:45.136
Been with you this long.

07:46.177 --> 07:47.537
The chairman is just concerned.

07:59.456 --> 08:01.376
Regarding some products'
declining reputation,

08:01.537 --> 08:03.177
we've replaced the relevant partners.

08:03.696 --> 08:05.816
Four companies
have shown interest in collaborating.

08:06.297 --> 08:07.177
No need to rush.

08:07.497 --> 08:10.097
Good companies stand out
through fierce competition.

08:10.737 --> 08:11.177
Okay.

08:19.497 --> 08:19.977
Miss Lin.

08:26.016 --> 08:27.256
Mr. Gao, hello.

08:45.736 --> 08:46.336
Are you okay?

08:46.937 --> 08:47.576
I'm fine.

08:56.616 --> 08:58.017
Miss, are you okay?

08:58.017 --> 08:58.576
I'm fine.

08:58.576 --> 08:59.257
Miss?

09:00.816 --> 09:01.417
Who are you?

09:03.576 --> 09:04.017
Move aside.

09:05.496 --> 09:06.856
Mr. Gao, long time...

09:16.976 --> 09:18.616
What a coincidence. We meet again.

09:19.257 --> 09:20.257
Move your car, please.

09:20.257 --> 09:21.216
You're blocking my car.

09:24.137 --> 09:25.216
Is it your car?

09:25.616 --> 09:26.456
I don't know.

09:26.856 --> 09:28.057
My car just broke down,

09:28.057 --> 09:29.417
so I stopped here to fix it.

09:30.736 --> 09:31.297
Boss,

09:31.736 --> 09:33.336
she's clearly targeting you.

09:34.736 --> 09:35.297
No.

09:36.336 --> 09:38.017
You have a deep misunderstanding of me.

09:38.576 --> 09:40.937
I think we need to start over.

09:41.496 --> 09:42.696
Need me to call a tow truck?

09:43.336 --> 09:45.137
No need, I'll drive away now.

09:57.177 --> 09:58.177
My car

09:58.177 --> 09:59.456
may not be fixed anytime soon.

10:00.537 --> 10:02.657
How about this?
I'll call someone to come fix it,

10:03.017 --> 10:05.496
and in the meantime,
we can grab some coffee

10:05.496 --> 10:06.096
and talk.

10:36.496 --> 10:37.576
Feels much better, right?

10:41.856 --> 10:44.976
The steering wheel-to-seat distance
and seat height don't suit you.

10:45.456 --> 10:46.456
It's not your car, right?

11:07.096 --> 11:07.736
Miss Lin,

11:08.177 --> 11:09.137
here's some advice.

11:09.736 --> 11:11.137
Direction outweighs effort.

11:11.496 --> 11:12.696
If the direction is wrong,

11:12.696 --> 11:14.177
no amount of effort will matter.

11:22.137 --> 11:23.576
Who do you think you are?

11:30.696 --> 11:34.137
Male Lead's fondness toward you: -80%,

11:34.377 --> 11:35.816
and it continues to drop.

11:37.496 --> 11:39.177
Darn fictional character.

11:44.976 --> 11:47.856
She silently devoted seven years
to her boyfriend.

11:48.257 --> 11:50.777
And now she calls me a lovesick fool?

11:53.496 --> 11:54.856
Sometimes I really wonder

11:55.417 --> 11:57.696
if there's another person
living inside her body.

12:00.777 --> 12:02.177
It's a very good story.

12:02.576 --> 12:03.897
I'm curious about her.

12:06.216 --> 12:09.257
Life always has its sudden surprises.

12:09.856 --> 12:12.137
Like her suddenly changed personality

12:12.696 --> 12:15.177
or some unexpected encounters.

12:18.377 --> 12:19.096
Sir,

12:19.696 --> 12:22.976
do you think that in a dimension
higher than ours,

12:23.616 --> 12:25.057
there exists a 'Hand of God,'

12:25.856 --> 12:28.657
and our fates were arranged long ago?

12:33.297 --> 12:34.017
Miss Mengmeng,

12:34.417 --> 12:36.937
I must say
your imagination is truly rich.

12:40.417 --> 12:43.417
But what I want to draw more
is the story of these two girls.

12:43.897 --> 12:47.297
As for the grand subject of fate,
let's leave that to fate itself.

12:50.576 --> 12:53.137
A story
with a touch of fantasy like this

12:53.576 --> 12:54.696
is actually very novel.

12:55.017 --> 12:57.777
I think the topic
should get past the editors.

12:58.336 --> 13:00.257
Besides, with the popularity
of Star and Firefly,

13:00.816 --> 13:03.017
readers will expect this one even more.

13:03.177 --> 13:04.017
In that case,

13:04.177 --> 13:06.336
will you start
after Star and Firefly finishes?

13:06.336 --> 13:06.937
No.

13:07.336 --> 13:08.537
I can start right now.

13:08.777 --> 13:10.017
I'm brimming with inspiration.

13:10.456 --> 13:11.017
Now?

13:11.297 --> 13:12.736
Yeah, take a look.

13:12.937 --> 13:14.057
(Her, Out of Nowhere)
The storyline

13:14.057 --> 13:15.017
and thematic style.

13:15.496 --> 13:16.976
There's character design too.

13:17.832 --> 13:19.335
(Comic Project Proposal)

13:21.216 --> 13:22.937
Not bad, Miss Mengmeng.

13:23.336 --> 13:24.816
Seems you came prepared.

13:26.496 --> 13:27.057
Alright then.

13:27.496 --> 13:29.177
I'll review this in the coming days.

13:35.696 --> 13:36.856
(Create a romance.)

13:37.336 --> 13:38.816
(Use your feminine charm)

13:39.137 --> 13:41.937
(to show your best visual effect.)

13:42.496 --> 13:46.377
(Or use some props
to achieve this goal.)

13:46.816 --> 13:49.057
(Like a fluffy pet.)

13:52.616 --> 13:53.377
Mr. Gao.

13:53.616 --> 13:55.096
What a coincidence meeting you here.

13:59.177 --> 13:59.976
Don't get me wrong.

14:00.496 --> 14:03.576
I saw an extremely adorable little bunny
by the roadside.

14:04.297 --> 14:05.976
I couldn't help but pick it up.

14:06.696 --> 14:08.017
Look, isn't it cute?

14:10.496 --> 14:11.137
Pet it.

14:11.216 --> 14:11.976
Stay away from me.

14:12.456 --> 14:13.736
I'm allergic to animal hair.

14:14.616 --> 14:15.177
Allergic?

14:17.736 --> 14:19.336
(I knew I couldn't trust that woman.)

14:20.816 --> 14:21.537
I'm sorry.

14:23.537 --> 14:24.537
I have tissues. Here.

14:24.537 --> 14:25.257
No, thanks.

14:25.937 --> 14:26.816
Hi, Player.

14:26.856 --> 14:28.336
Since you're new to this world,

14:28.456 --> 14:30.177
we're distributing
an exclusive item now.

14:30.297 --> 14:31.336
Please use it wisely.

14:32.017 --> 14:32.856
Wipe off.

14:43.137 --> 14:43.657
Wait.

14:44.177 --> 14:45.576
W-What's happening?

14:45.897 --> 14:48.696
Wait. This... I-I...

14:52.496 --> 14:53.057
Miss Lin,

14:53.937 --> 14:55.537
I hope we don't meet again.

15:04.496 --> 15:07.616
Wait. How am I supposed to explain this?

15:10.736 --> 15:11.616
Congratulations.

15:11.777 --> 15:13.177
After your series of efforts,

15:13.456 --> 15:15.336
Male Lead's fondness toward you

15:15.336 --> 15:17.377
has finally dropped to -100%.

15:17.377 --> 15:18.897
Negative 100%? That's insane.

15:19.297 --> 15:21.696
Although the fondness keeps dropping,

15:22.017 --> 15:24.377
this has triggered
the system's punishment quest.

15:24.377 --> 15:24.937
Punishment?

15:25.096 --> 15:26.096
You're punishing me?

15:26.096 --> 15:27.576
Why should I accept any punishment?

15:33.736 --> 15:34.537
Pull over up ahead.

15:35.856 --> 15:36.616
What is it, boss?

15:37.417 --> 15:40.496
That sanitary pad earlier
was really gentle on the skin.

15:41.657 --> 15:42.377
Pretty soft.

15:43.576 --> 15:44.816
What brand was it?

15:46.937 --> 15:47.897
Find a supermarket.

15:49.537 --> 15:49.976
Got it.

16:05.096 --> 16:05.537
Look.

16:09.976 --> 16:11.096
So handsome.

16:11.616 --> 16:12.336
Let's take a look.

16:12.377 --> 16:13.297
Let's go.

16:23.456 --> 16:25.377
A man taking so many sanitary pads?

16:25.657 --> 16:26.816
How odd.

16:29.032 --> 16:29.960
(Flex Fit, Silky Soft)

16:44.057 --> 16:44.897
Dear Player,

16:44.897 --> 16:45.976
accept your punishment

16:46.257 --> 16:47.456
and begin your performance.

16:48.496 --> 16:49.496
What does that mean?

16:50.257 --> 16:51.856
You want me to clean the toilets?

16:52.496 --> 16:53.736
Make sure they're spotless.

16:54.777 --> 16:55.937
Are you kidding me?

16:59.816 --> 17:02.777
Wait. Didn't you tell me
to win over Gao Haiming?

17:02.777 --> 17:03.696
Just let me out now.

17:03.696 --> 17:05.056
I'll win him over today.

17:05.897 --> 17:07.817
You must accept
the system's punishment first.

17:08.296 --> 17:10.296
What will you do if I refuse?

17:10.976 --> 17:13.256
Then you must clean
all the building's toilets.

17:13.256 --> 17:14.937
In your dreams!

17:31.617 --> 17:32.536
Congratulations.

17:32.577 --> 17:33.736
Your punishment is over.

17:34.016 --> 17:36.016
You may now resume the main quest.

17:40.337 --> 17:42.536
You evil, lousy system!

17:43.137 --> 17:44.817
What's the point of punishing me?

17:45.817 --> 17:47.256
It's to make you understand

17:47.657 --> 17:49.137
slacking off comes with a price.

17:49.137 --> 17:50.536
When have I ever slacked off?

17:50.536 --> 17:51.976
I've been working very hard!

17:53.016 --> 17:54.577
Then you're not trying hard enough.

17:55.177 --> 17:57.657
Since your Love at First Sight quest
has failed,

17:57.817 --> 17:59.417
let's settle for the next best option.

18:00.097 --> 18:03.296
Now complete the quest of establishing
a work connection with Gao Haiming.

18:05.377 --> 18:06.177
Meaning?

18:06.857 --> 18:09.177
So you're saying
I have to go work at Letao now?

18:16.047 --> 18:17.448
(Letao Tower)

18:22.296 --> 18:23.016
Board members,

18:23.256 --> 18:26.137
this year, the market share
of the Lovebaby diapers we represent

18:26.137 --> 18:27.296
firmly holds the top spot,

18:27.736 --> 18:28.817
but compared to last year,

18:29.097 --> 18:31.216
our growth trend
has decreased by eight percent.

18:31.897 --> 18:32.657
In summary,

18:32.657 --> 18:34.016
for the first half of 1999,

18:34.016 --> 18:36.296
(Product Competitiveness Analysis)
Letao product profit growth is slowing,

18:36.577 --> 18:37.657
with profits declining.

18:41.097 --> 18:42.016
Board members,

18:42.617 --> 18:45.536
Letao's current situation
is not optimistic.

18:45.817 --> 18:47.736
So, we're having this meeting today

18:47.736 --> 18:51.256
also to hear any good suggestions
you board members might have.

18:51.536 --> 18:53.776
I believe we should expand
the scope of our advertising.

18:54.536 --> 18:55.256
I think

18:55.256 --> 18:57.937
we should make some adjustments
to our sales strategy.

18:58.216 --> 19:02.256
I think we should partner more
with large companies like Fuchuang

19:02.617 --> 19:04.097
to jointly develop the market.

19:06.377 --> 19:07.056
Haiming,

19:07.976 --> 19:08.736
what do you think?

19:10.137 --> 19:11.256
If we want to break through,

19:12.456 --> 19:13.817
we must end conventional thinking.

19:14.056 --> 19:16.817
I believe we should develop
our own products

19:17.296 --> 19:20.016
and set up production lines,
especially for feminine hygiene.

19:20.296 --> 19:22.937
Only then can we comprehensively
overcome the current bottleneck.

19:24.377 --> 19:26.177
We haven't even done market research.

19:26.337 --> 19:27.056
Exactly.

19:27.496 --> 19:29.256
We also lack production experience.

19:32.496 --> 19:34.137
Luo, distribute the materials.

19:36.776 --> 19:37.800
(Proposal
for Self-Developed Sanitary Pads)

19:38.937 --> 19:40.296
Please read the materials.

19:40.857 --> 19:41.617
(Market Background &amp; Demand Analysis)
They analyze

19:41.617 --> 19:44.177
similarities and differences
between sanitary pads and diapers.

19:44.177 --> 19:47.056
They're very similar
in manufacturing process and materials.

19:47.056 --> 19:47.859
(Proposal
for Self-Developed Sanitary Pads)

19:48.417 --> 19:49.056
These are

19:49.056 --> 19:50.296
(Sanitary Pad Skin Friction Test)
nine common sanitary pads on the market,

19:50.696 --> 19:54.377
showing skin redness
after a 100-rub friction test.

19:54.377 --> 19:55.696
You can see the results directly.

19:56.337 --> 19:57.657
As for the Lovebaby brand...

19:58.137 --> 19:59.897
Mr. Gao, your wrist?

20:01.736 --> 20:02.216
It's fine.

20:05.417 --> 20:06.617
But have you considered

20:07.577 --> 20:11.736
the time cost, labor cost,
and financial cost required?

20:12.016 --> 20:13.337
The risk is extremely high.

20:14.177 --> 20:15.536
If it succeeds, it's fine.

20:15.536 --> 20:16.577
But if it fails,

20:16.577 --> 20:19.577
how am I supposed
to justify that to the board?

20:19.937 --> 20:22.177
So let's table this matter
for later discussion.

20:22.897 --> 20:24.617
That's all for today. Meeting adjourned.

20:25.417 --> 20:26.256
- Okay.
- Okay, okay.

20:32.857 --> 20:33.417
Haiming,

20:34.177 --> 20:34.857
stay.

20:35.177 --> 20:36.256
I need to talk to you.

20:39.016 --> 20:39.657
Mr. Gao,

20:39.657 --> 20:41.216
the interviews need you.

20:42.177 --> 20:42.696
Chairman,

20:43.337 --> 20:44.097
I have interviews.

20:44.296 --> 20:44.976
We'll talk later.

20:52.456 --> 20:54.056
(Proposal
for Self-Developed Sanitary Pads)

20:54.056 --> 20:55.976
Developing sanitary pads?

20:57.256 --> 20:58.617
Not doing proper work all day.

20:58.617 --> 21:00.056
No idea what's on his mind.

21:03.976 --> 21:04.456
Look.

21:04.897 --> 21:05.857
I think it looks fine.

21:07.016 --> 21:08.496
Just write it like you have it.

21:08.857 --> 21:10.137
I think that should be enough.

21:15.736 --> 21:16.657
I think it's enough.

21:18.857 --> 21:19.337
Actually,

21:19.337 --> 21:21.097
seeing so many people makes me nervous.

21:22.097 --> 21:22.776
Have we started?

21:22.776 --> 21:23.256
Almost.

21:23.776 --> 21:26.137
Put all the interviewee resumes
in Mr. Gao's office later.

21:26.137 --> 21:26.536
Okay.

21:26.897 --> 21:28.496
Hand all your resumes to me now.

21:30.976 --> 21:31.696
- Excuse me.
- Mine.

21:31.937 --> 21:32.377
Excuse me.

21:32.857 --> 21:34.097
When is my turn?

21:34.097 --> 21:35.377
In order, you're the last one.

21:40.617 --> 21:41.496
Do you have scissors?

21:41.496 --> 21:42.216
May I borrow them?

21:48.440 --> 21:51.176
(Resume)

21:51.657 --> 21:52.296
Lin Huan'er?

21:56.937 --> 21:58.976
So I think we need to start over.

21:59.177 --> 22:00.657
I'd like to introduce myself to you.

22:00.657 --> 22:01.256
- No need.
- I...

22:01.256 --> 22:02.937
I know you're not Miss Zhu Mengmeng.

22:03.456 --> 22:05.456
Your misunderstanding of me
is far too deep.

22:05.657 --> 22:08.056
I think we need to start over.

22:08.577 --> 22:09.216
Mr. Gao.

22:10.417 --> 22:12.177
What a coincidence. We meet again.

22:25.456 --> 22:26.216
Cutting in line.

22:32.696 --> 22:34.296
All forms were the same size.

22:34.577 --> 22:36.016
Why is this smaller when submitted?

22:36.657 --> 22:37.776
The form's been cut down.

22:37.937 --> 22:39.216
It slips out when organizing.

22:39.776 --> 22:41.177
So it's easily placed on top.

22:41.536 --> 22:43.097
Lin Huan'er is absolutely relentless.

22:43.657 --> 22:44.817
I'll kick her out right away.

22:45.056 --> 22:45.496
Wait.

22:48.496 --> 22:49.976
- Where are you going?
- To interview them.

23:04.857 --> 23:05.897
Hello, I'm Lin Huan'er.

23:06.056 --> 23:08.617
I'm applying
for the position of GM's assistant.

23:15.736 --> 23:18.296
We are not hiring a GM's assistant.

23:19.736 --> 23:21.016
I believe Mr. Gao needs one.

23:26.496 --> 23:30.097
What qualities do you think
this role should possess?

23:30.657 --> 23:32.056
And what qualities do you possess?

23:33.937 --> 23:37.657
Patience, meticulousness,
and responsibility. I possess them all.

23:38.536 --> 23:39.976
But most importantly,

23:40.736 --> 23:43.177
I know your general manager inside out.

24:01.536 --> 24:02.256
Miss Lin,

24:02.976 --> 24:03.617
you're smart.

24:04.736 --> 24:06.976
But it isn't enough
for you to be my assistant.

24:11.496 --> 24:13.137
No wonder you're the boss.

24:14.016 --> 24:17.617
Even my smallest thoughts
can't escape your notice.

24:18.857 --> 24:19.496
Flattery?

24:20.976 --> 24:23.617
Just a tiny bit of rainbow flattery.

24:24.256 --> 24:25.417
Doesn't it sound acceptable?

24:26.897 --> 24:28.216
Rainbow flattery?

24:35.016 --> 24:38.296
Actually, I have many ideas for Letao.

24:39.657 --> 24:40.056
Go ahead.

24:40.897 --> 24:44.496
First, I believe Letao
shouldn't confine itself to agency work.

24:44.976 --> 24:46.817
We need our own production line.

24:47.536 --> 24:48.097
I believe

24:48.456 --> 24:52.256
you aim to build it
into a unicorn company in the future.

24:53.177 --> 24:53.817
Unicorn?

24:54.657 --> 24:55.456
Second,

24:55.776 --> 24:58.137
we should focus on user experience.

24:58.976 --> 25:00.296
We must seek new directions,

25:00.976 --> 25:01.976
identify pain points,

25:01.976 --> 25:02.736
provide solutions,

25:03.216 --> 25:05.976
and deliver exceptional
user experiences.

25:06.696 --> 25:07.496
Finally,

25:07.897 --> 25:11.337
the future belongs to AI and big data.

25:11.337 --> 25:12.976
The era of online shopping
is approaching.

25:13.617 --> 25:17.016
We must be ready for an intelligent,
automated, and interconnected future

25:17.377 --> 25:18.817
and embrace the internet.

25:23.016 --> 25:24.137
- What's she saying?
- No idea.

25:24.137 --> 25:24.968
I can't understand.

25:26.536 --> 25:27.056
That's all.

25:28.256 --> 25:28.857
Miss Lin,

25:29.897 --> 25:31.417
you applied to be the GM's assistant.

25:31.857 --> 25:32.937
Your job is

25:33.137 --> 25:34.177
to aid the general manager

25:34.177 --> 25:35.016
and serve him.

25:36.016 --> 25:38.177
Only one person
can judge your competence.

25:39.617 --> 25:40.137
You.

25:43.137 --> 25:45.137
I regret to say
you didn't pass the interview.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.016
Mr. Gao.

25:53.016 --> 25:56.256
Miss Lin, turn right after exiting
for the elevator.

26:07.496 --> 26:08.216
She won't leave.

26:09.976 --> 26:10.657
You're so sure?

26:12.097 --> 26:13.097
After all that effort,

26:14.016 --> 26:15.256
she won't give up easily.

26:31.657 --> 26:33.696
Male Lead's fondness toward you
has increased,

26:33.937 --> 26:35.817
currently at -80%.

26:36.216 --> 26:38.617
But you still haven't secured
a position at Letao.

26:38.976 --> 26:40.177
Current quest continues.

26:40.377 --> 26:43.897
Find every way to establish work ties
with Gao Haiming.

26:51.656 --> 26:52.840
(Resume)

27:03.536 --> 27:05.216
(Even at -80%,)

27:05.536 --> 27:06.776
(but no one knows the ending)

27:06.776 --> 27:08.216
(until the last page is turned.)

27:19.456 --> 27:20.097
I'm sorry.

27:21.976 --> 27:25.137
I know my recent actions
have been confusing.

27:26.256 --> 27:27.736
So let me explain.

27:30.536 --> 27:32.526
I have unavoidable reasons.

27:32.526 --> 27:35.417
That's why I'm trying so hard
to change your bad impression of me.

27:37.617 --> 27:40.016
Is starting low and ending high
also your strategy?

27:40.577 --> 27:42.056
I wonder if you've experienced this.

27:42.496 --> 27:45.496
Being stranded alone
in unfamiliar territory,

27:45.736 --> 27:47.536
everything around you feels alien.

27:47.817 --> 27:50.256
So you desperately seek an exit.

27:52.177 --> 27:53.097
The exit you mentioned

27:53.617 --> 27:56.857
means finding someone
like me or Mr. Lu, right?

27:59.256 --> 28:00.976
I know you don't trust anything I say.

28:01.417 --> 28:04.817
But I'm asking for one more chance.

28:05.097 --> 28:06.016
Let me stay at Letao.

28:16.216 --> 28:17.857
Who told you I frequent the model shop?

28:19.097 --> 28:20.456
Who's helping you know me?

28:22.536 --> 28:25.696
Our meeting at that shop
was no coincidence.

28:29.536 --> 28:30.577
If I could give spoilers,

28:30.577 --> 28:32.097
I'd have explained everything.

28:32.577 --> 28:34.337
But the point is, I can't say anything.

28:35.137 --> 28:35.976
Regardless,

28:35.976 --> 28:37.617
please believe I mean no harm.

28:38.657 --> 28:40.337
I hope you'll accept my apology.

28:42.256 --> 28:43.240
Sorry for the trouble.

28:44.177 --> 28:44.696
Wait.

28:56.976 --> 28:58.897
What brand was the pad
you gave me last time?

29:02.056 --> 29:02.617
Just a survey.

29:04.337 --> 29:05.456
Sure.

29:05.456 --> 29:06.377
Let me find you one.

29:16.817 --> 29:17.496
I'm out.

29:19.776 --> 29:20.897
Do you have any pads then?

29:20.897 --> 29:21.577
Give me one.

29:24.937 --> 29:26.056
Never mind. I'm leaving.

29:31.417 --> 29:32.496
Review this proposal.

29:32.536 --> 29:33.937
Revise this section.

29:34.337 --> 29:34.857
Excuse me.

29:35.216 --> 29:36.536
Do you have any sanitary pads?

29:36.536 --> 29:37.456
Could you spare one?

29:42.577 --> 29:43.817
It's the new millennium.

29:43.817 --> 29:44.937
Why the period shame?

29:48.097 --> 29:50.016
Excuse me.
Do you have any sanitary pads?

30:11.536 --> 30:11.976
Thank you.

30:25.337 --> 30:26.296
What's happening?

30:26.296 --> 30:26.897
No idea.

30:26.897 --> 30:27.536
She left.

30:27.657 --> 30:28.377
Did you see that?

30:28.577 --> 30:30.024
Mr. Gao gave her sanitary pads.

30:30.377 --> 30:30.976
Mr. Gao and...

30:42.056 --> 30:44.417
Male Lead's fondness toward you
has increased

30:44.617 --> 30:46.657
and is currently at -50%.

31:08.897 --> 31:09.696
What is it?

31:09.937 --> 31:12.536
Still upset about
not passing Letao's interview?

31:13.857 --> 31:14.696
You know nothing.

31:16.296 --> 31:16.976
It's fine.

31:17.657 --> 31:19.056
If you can't get into Letao,

31:19.577 --> 31:22.177
you can attend its owner's banquet

31:22.177 --> 31:24.016
and meet this weird man
selling sanitary pads.

31:29.320 --> 31:31.617
(Letao Banquet &amp; Celebration
of Founder's Pearl Wedding Anniversary)

31:31.617 --> 31:32.456
7:00 PM?

31:34.976 --> 31:36.216
We're running late, Mengmeng.

31:54.984 --> 31:57.846
(30th Pearl Wedding Anniversary)

32:10.417 --> 32:11.216
Thank you, everyone.

32:11.657 --> 32:13.617
Our partners and dear friends,

32:13.617 --> 32:17.776
thank you for being here to celebrate
our Pearl Wedding Anniversary with us.

32:18.496 --> 32:23.056
My wife and I have walked hand in hand
for thirty years.

32:24.056 --> 32:25.456
My love for her

32:26.496 --> 32:31.417
goes beyond my instant infatuation
when we first met.

32:32.337 --> 32:36.177
It also goes beyond her giving me
such a wonderful son

32:36.657 --> 32:39.216
and building our warm, happy family.

32:39.536 --> 32:44.296
So, on this special commemorative day,

32:44.736 --> 32:48.177
I've prepared a unique gift for my wife.

32:55.056 --> 32:56.456
Let me show you.

32:57.137 --> 32:58.577
It holds special meaning.

32:59.137 --> 33:01.177
For thirty years of marriage,

33:02.137 --> 33:06.337
I've selected thirty precious pearls,

33:06.337 --> 33:07.456
strung together.

33:08.296 --> 33:09.417
I present this to my wife.

33:27.296 --> 33:29.776
May her future journey

33:30.296 --> 33:34.256
shine like this pearl necklace,

33:34.776 --> 33:37.577
radiant and luminous forever.

34:01.792 --> 34:04.775
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:05.984 --> 34:08.755
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:10.656 --> 34:16.569
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:18.366 --> 34:21.426
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:22.592 --> 34:26.044
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:27.040 --> 34:32.566
♪Until the world's end♪

34:34.976 --> 34:38.772
♪If I could♪

34:39.360 --> 34:42.176
♪Keep loving you♪

34:43.200 --> 34:45.600
♪Hearing two hearts♪

34:45.600 --> 34:50.516
♪Beating together♪

34:51.488 --> 34:55.352
♪If I could♪

34:55.352 --> 34:58.592
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

34:59.648 --> 35:06.973
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

35:08.032 --> 35:10.976
